1
00:00:00,770 --> 00:00:03,270
(Wyatt:)Says he loves you.

2
00:00:03,270 --> 00:00:05,470
(Leonard:)What?

3
00:00:06,740 --> 00:00:08,240
(Penny:)I see.

4
00:00:08,240 --> 00:00:10,310
(Wyatt:)The whole thing's
bull squirt, huh?

5
00:00:12,010 --> 00:00:14,310
(Wyatt:)Well, that's very disappointing.

6
00:00:14,310 --> 00:00:16,510
(Penny:)Bye.

7
00:00:22,550 --> 00:00:23,950
(Penny:)Oh, hey.

8
00:00:23,960 --> 00:00:26,920
(Leonard:)There's been something I've
been meaning to tell you.

9
00:00:28,010 --> 00:00:30,290
(Wyatt:)I can't believe you would
lie to me like that.

10
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:32,000
(Leonard:)Just for the record, I did not
want to be a part of this.

11
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:33,260
(Wyatt:)I'll get to you in a minute.

12
00:00:33,260 --> 00:00:35,230
(Leonard:)No hurry.

13
00:00:35,230 --> 00:00:37,330
(Wyatt:)That my own daughter thinks
I don't love her enough

14
00:00:37,340 --> 00:00:39,190
(Wyatt:)to support her no matter
what choices she makes--

15
00:00:39,190 --> 00:00:40,270
(Wyatt:)well, that hurts me deeply.

16
00:00:40,270 --> 00:00:41,510
(Penny:)I'm sorry, Daddy...
Let me finish.

17
00:00:41,510 --> 00:00:42,770
(Leonard:)Oh.

18
00:00:42,770 --> 00:00:44,140
(Wyatt:)I thought we were
past the days

19
00:00:44,140 --> 00:00:46,480
(Wyatt:)when you would try
to pull the wool over my eyes.

20
00:00:46,480 --> 00:00:49,750
(Wyatt:)Telling me the baggie in your
underwear drawer is potpourri?

21
00:00:50,920 --> 00:00:52,380
(Wyatt:)And the pee stick
in your bathroom

22
00:00:52,380 --> 00:00:54,450
(Wyatt:)is to check for diabetes?

23
00:00:58,390 --> 00:01:00,320
(Penny:)You know, I'm sorry.

